 .../src/main/resources/incident.graphql       | 20 +------------------
 docs/how/updating-datahub.md                  |  2 ++
 docs/incidents/incidents.md                   | 15 +++++++++-----
 4 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

